    "Id": "chassisdef_spartan_SPT-N1",
    "Name": "Spartan",
    "Details": "The earliest model of the <i>Spartan</i> assault 'Mech. The N1 suffered from inadequate cooling for its advanced weapons systems, which led to the design being revised into the more heat-efficient N2 in 2765. Despite this, a handful of N1 models still made their way into the hands of various buyers across the Sphere.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>",
