  "StockRole": "Skirmisher",
  "YangsThoughts": "Do you have any idea how rare this 'Mech is, Boss? You're looking at one of the last remaining <i>Spartan</i> assault 'Mechs. Not only that, but this is one of the original N1 models! I mean — it's worse in every single way than the N2, but hey! It's rarer!",
